  "voice": {
    "post_text": [
      "Sweet little Persimmon the hognose snake recently came to see the team at All Creatures Veterinary Hospital after developing an abscess that needed medical attention. 🐍💚\n\nThanks to the compassionate care of Dr. Daniel and her dedicated medical team, Persimmon received the treatment she needed and is now feeling SO much better! From her exam and treatment plan to recovery and healing, this brave girl was surrounded by a team that truly cares about every creature — no matter how tiny. ✨\n\nReptiles are experts at hiding illness, which is why routine exams and early intervention are so important. If you notice swelling, changes in appetite, unusual behavior, or anything out of the ordinary with your exotic pet, don’t wait to have them evaluated.\n\nWe are so proud of Persimmon and thankful we could help her on the road to recovery! 🐍💕\n\n#hognosesnake #exoticpet #VeterinaryCare"
    ],
